1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,020
See the raw FIX file

2
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:10,440
Enable FIX mode with :set ft=fix.

3
00:00:10,440 --> 00:00:19,300
Find Side in the symbol picker and jump to the tag.

4
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:22,880
Press K to open hover for Side(54).

5
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:28,980
Follow the bid: move between fields with ]] and back with [[.

6
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:37,760
Copy the decoded bid size with :VenueReader yank and paste it into a split.

7
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:42,700
Change the bid size from 200 to 2000. Look for the integrity diagnostics.

8
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:50,440
Apply the quick fix to repair BodyLength and CheckSum while keeping the new size.

9
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:55,320
Hover tag 789 to see NextExpectedMsgSeqNum in FIX 4.4.

10
00:00:55,320 --> 00:01:03,220
Switch the session dictionary to FIX 4.3.

11
00:01:03,220 --> 00:01:12,620
Change the Logon to FIX 4.3. Tag 789 now requires FIX 4.4.

12
00:01:12,620 --> 00:01:25,200
Turn off summaries and the dictionary version warning for this file.
